OL,3,GNEWSAMiners institute 'deeply affected'
OL,4,Aby coach death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA miners' welfare club has been "deeply
OL,7,Faffected" after one of its members was
OL,8,Fhit by a coach and killed at a service
OL,9,Fstation, its leaders have said.
OL,11,FThe man was pronounced dead at the
OL,12,Fscene after being struck at Rivington
OL,13,Fservices on the M61 near Chorley in
OL,14,FLancashire at about 14:30 GMT on
OL,15,FSunday.
OL,17,FThurcroft Miners Institute, based in
OL,18,FRotherham, South Yorkshire, said in a
OL,19,Fstatement the driver had believed all
OL,20,Fpassengers had already got off and the
OL,21,Fman had been standing behind the coach
OL,22,Fas it was reversing when he was hit.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
