OL,3,GNEWSAMiners institute 'deeply affected'
OL,4,Aby coach death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club's leaders added that their
OL,7,F"thoughts and sympathies go out to the
OL,8,Fdeceased's family, friends, and those
OL,9,Fmembers who are affected by this tragic
OL,10,Faccident".
